{"id":"661395","name":"板栗蒸鸡","author":"_蒍鉨变乖々","authorId":"8010238","desc":"*本菜谱为作者独家发布于美食天下，禁止其他平台或个人转载。","cover":"images/661395/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"鸡腿肉","amount":"适量"},{"name":"板栗","amount":"适量"}],"sub":[{"name":"生姜","amount":"适量"},{"name":"葱花","amount":"适量"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"斩块的鸡腿洗净备用。","img":"images/661395/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"生姜切细备用。","img":"images/661395/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"板栗冷水下锅煮开。","img":"images/661395/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"鸡腿加入姜丝。","img":"images/661395/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"加入生抽，蚝油，盐，玉米淀粉，花生油抓拌均匀腌制半小时左右。","img":"images/661395/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"煮开的板栗去皮备用。","img":"images/661395/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"鸡腿肉放入板栗拌匀。","img":"images/661395/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"将鸡腿肉和板栗均匀的铺在盘中。","img":"images/661395/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"锅中水开上锅蒸15-20分钟左右。","img":"images/661395/step_9.jpg"},{"step":10,"desc":"出锅前再加入适量葱花即可。","img":"images/661395/step_10.jpg"},{"step":11,"desc":"成品。","img":"images/661395/step_11.jpg"},{"step":12,"desc":"成品。","img":"images/661395/step_12.jpg"},{"step":13,"desc":"成品。","img":"images/661395/step_13.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：蒸锅、炒锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}